  "name": "Recruiting Message Generation Agent",
  "description": "This agent generates messages to be sent to candidates on behalf of recruiting team members across Email, SMS and WhatsApp channels. It handles both one-to-one and bulk messages. This agent can also generate email conversation summary.",
